  "we_are_an_architecture_and_interior_de.58b8": "We are an architecture and interior design studio shaping homes, workspaces and everything in between — designed for how you actually live.",
  "we_cover_six_things.b93b": "We cover six things:",
  "we_do_not_do_heroic_overtime_tired_peo.18cb": "We do not do heroic overtime. Tired people draw badly and miss things, and someone has to pay for that later.",
  "we_draw_it_and_get_it_approved_you_app.eb98": "We draw it and get it approved. You appoint your own builder and run the site with our drawings in hand.",
  "we_have_grown_since_into_interiors_wor.8bbc": "We have grown since, into interiors, workspaces and restoration, but the method is the same. We spend the first weeks listening, measuring, and watching where the light lands. The drawing comes after.",
  "we_hire_slowly_br_and_keep_people.bbb2": "We hire slowly,<br>and keep people.",
