  "we_meet_on_site_if_we_can.9a68": "We meet, on site if we can",
  "we_modelled_our_own_building_the_way_w.69b9": "We modelled our own building the way we model yours. Scroll the fly-through on the home page and the camera takes you in through the entrance, down the drafting hall past the service boards, around the model bay and back out again — in daylight or at night, your choice.",
  "we_never_pass_your_details_to_anyone_e.80fa": "We never pass your details to anyone else. No newsletter unless you ask for one.",
  "we_prepare_and_submit_the_whole_applic.8f23": "We prepare and submit the whole application and deal with the case officer through to the decision. We will also tell you honestly, at the first meeting, how likely it is to be granted.",
  "we_read_every_enquiry_ourselves_and_yo.e45e": "We read every enquiry ourselves, and you&rsquo;ll hear back within two working days. If it is urgent, call the studio on <a href=\"tel:+10000000000\">+1 (000) 000-0000</a>.",
  "we_read_it_and_reply.6a5f": "We read it and reply",
  "we_stay_on_site_until_the_keys_change.d230": "We stay on site until the keys change hands. The people who drew it are the people who see it finished.",
  "we_take_it_from_the_first_site_visit_t.5785": "We take it from the first site visit to the day you move in — design, drawings, permissions, tender and site.",
  "we_took_a_floor_of_a_working_foundry_b.3e4e": "We took a floor of a working foundry building in 2014 and did to it exactly what we tell clients to do: kept the good bones, opened it up, and put the light where the work is.",
  "we_visit_measure_and_talk_about_routin.aa81": "We visit, measure and talk — about routine, not style. What time you eat, where you work, which room nobody uses. The brief comes out of that conversation.",
