  "yes_mdash_one_meeting_on_site_or_at_th.cd60": "Yes &mdash; one meeting, on site or at the studio, with no charge and nothing to sign. If you then want a written feasibility note before committing to a full project, that is a small fixed fee we deduct from the design fee later.",
  "yes_one_reimagined_room_is_a_real_proj.810e": "Yes. One reimagined room is a real project if the thinking is worth doing, and some of our best work has been the smallest. If the job genuinely does not need an architect we will tell you that instead of taking the fee.",
